  "prefLabel": "Ncr 854.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 854.01 Applicability. In addition to rules found in Ncr 852, the provisions of Ncr 854 shall apply to all ATV, UTV, and trail bike trails on department properties.\n\nSource. #14288, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
